nodes.instructions:
Apply the brainstorming skill to this idea:

{{idea}}

Explore the project context, list the open questions and 2-3 approaches with trade-offs, and recommend one. End with a short design document.

Apply the writing-plans skill to the approved design:

{{design}}

Split the work into small tasks, each with its files, the test to write first and how to verify it.

Execute the plan task by task on an isolated branch:

{{plan}}

For each task write the failing test first, make it pass with the minimal code, and debug failures systematically. If there is review feedback below, apply the receiving-code-review skill to it first.

{{prev}}
